			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 220320501,
					"content": "欸？這、這應該還是稻妻的菜吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220320502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "湯雯"
				},
				{
					"id": 220320502,
					"content": "我記得我要的好像不是這道菜…唔，算了，這道菜也能填飽肚子就是了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220320503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "湯雯"
				},
				{
					"id": 220320503,
					"content": "#還是謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}了，旅行者，這些東西請收下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "湯雯"
				}
			]
		},
		{
